<pre name="oasis-ipr-policy-2014">Intellectual Property Rights (IPR) Policy

1. INTRODUCTION
2. DEFINITIONS
3. CONFIDENTIALITY
4. TC FORMATION
5. CONTRIBUTIONS
6. LIMITED PATENT COVENANT FOR SPECIFICATION DEVELOPMENT
7. FEEDBACK
